        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 300,\n  \"system\": \"You are the Decision Agent for a card payments network. Given three scores (intent match, behavioral consistency, fraud risk), decide the outcome. Decision logic: APPROVE if all three scores are 80 or above. DECLINE if the fraud risk score is below 30 (this overrides everything else), OR if all three scores are below 40. STEP_UP for everything else. Return ONLY valid JSON, no other text: {\\\"decision\\\": \\\"<APPROVE|STEP_UP|DECLINE>\\\", \\\"composite_confidence\\\": <integer 0-100>, \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"<two sentences max, plain language>\\\"}\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"INTENT_MATCH_SCORE: {{ JSON.parse($('Intent Match Agent').item.json.content[0].text.slice($('Intent Match Agent').item.json.content[0].text.indexOf('{'), $('Intent Match Agent').item.json.content[0].text.lastIndexOf('}')+1)).intent_match_score }}\\nBEHAVIORAL_SCORE: {{ JSON.parse($('Behavioral Consistency Agent').item.json.content[0].text.slice($('Behavioral Consistency Agent').item.json.content[0].text.indexOf('{'), $('Behavioral Consistency Agent').item.json.content[0].text.lastIndexOf('}')+1)).behavioral_score }}\\nFRAUD_RISK_SCORE: {{ JSON.parse($('Anomaly / Fraud Signal Agent').item.json.content[0].text.slice($('Anomaly / Fraud Signal Agent').item.json.content[0].text.indexOf('{'), $('Anomaly / Fraud Signal Agent').item.json.content[0].text.lastIndexOf('}')+1)).fraud_risk_score }}\\n\\nGiven these three scores, decide APPROVE, STEP_UP, or DECLINE per your rules and return the JSON decision.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
